// New Federated Domain Added | T1484.002 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/cloud/m365/audit/microsoft365_new_federated_domain_added_audit.yml
Operation:*domain* AND (Operation:(*add* OR *new*))

// Stellar Cyber Query Builder (DSL):
{
  "query": {
